<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">TV Remote Control Anal=
ogy</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Think of AbortController nh=C6=
=B0 m=E1=BB=99t <strong>universal remote control</strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>AbortController</strong=
> =3D Remote control device</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>AbortSignal</strong> =
=3D Infrared beam t=E1=BB=AB remote</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Async operations</stron=
g> =3D Various devices (TV, soundbar, lights)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>abort()</strong> =3D Pr=
essing the "power off" button</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Khi b=E1=BA=A1n press "power off=
":</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Remote sends signal to ALL pair=
ed devices</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Each device decides how to hand=
le signal</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Some turn off immediately, some=
 fadeout gracefully</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Remote's job done, kh=C3=B4ng c=
=E1=BA=A7n track individual devices</li>
</ol>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=92=AD Mental Mo=
del Formation Story</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Khi t=C3=B4i =C4=91=E1=BA=A7u ti=
=C3=AAn encounter AbortController, t=C3=B4i confused v=E1=BB=81 relationshi=
p gi=E1=BB=AFa Controller v=C3=A0 Signal. T=C3=B4i ngh=C4=A9:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"T=E1=BA=A1i sao kh=C3=B4ng dir=
ectly call <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300=
 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9r=
em]">signal.abort()</code>?"</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"Why need separate Controller o=
bject?"</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Aha moment</strong> came=
 khi t=C3=B4i realize =C4=91=C3=A2y l=C3=A0 <strong>separation of concerns<=
/strong>:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
