munication channel</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Async operations</stron=
g> =3D Receivers</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Controller can create multiple s=
ignals, nh=C6=B0ng m=E1=BB=97i signal ch=E1=BB=89 c=C3=B3 m=E1=BB=99t contr=
oller. N=C3=B3 gi=E1=BB=91ng nh=C6=B0 CEO (Controller) c=C3=B3 th=E1=BB=83 =
issue multiple memos (Signals) =C4=91=E1=BA=BFn different departments.</p>
