<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">M=E1=BB=97i musician (callback) =
ph=E1=BA=A3i manually coordinate v=E1=BB=9Bi next musician. If violinist ma=
kes mistake, entire performance disrupted.</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Promise Era =3D Sheet =
