<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Conductor (async function) orche=
strates entire performance, pausing v=C3=A0 resuming sections as needed.</p=
>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">AbortController Era =
=3D Emergency Stop Button</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">When fire alarm rings (user acti=
