<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Traditional Approach =
=3D Single Operator v=E1=BB=9Bi Stopwatch</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Operator follows rigid schedule:=
</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"Set red, wait 3 minutes"</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"Set yellow, wait 1 minute"</li=
>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"Set green, wait 2 minutes"</li=
>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">"Repeat"</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Problems: No flexibility, cannot=
 handle emergencies, difficult to coordinate.</p>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">State Machine =3D Smar=
