("We are in RED phase")</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Valid transitions</stro=
ng> ("From RED, we can only go to YELLOW")</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>External events</strong=
> ("Emergency vehicle approaching")</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Context</strong> ("This=
 is cycle #47, been running for 3 hours")</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Benefits: Flexible, traceable, t=
estable, recoverable.</p>
