<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">=F0=9F=92=AD Why This =
Design? Historical Context</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>1995</strong>: Brendan E=
ich created JavaScript trong 10 ng=C3=A0y t=E1=BA=A1i Netscape. Main goal: =
simple scripting language cho web pages. Multi-threading would:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Add complexity</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Create race conditions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Require synchronization primiti=
ves</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Make debugging harder</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Single-threaded + Event =
Loop</strong> was elegant solution:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No race conditions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Predictable execution order</li=
>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Simple mental model</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Perfect cho DOM manipulation</l=
i>
</ul>
