<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">=F0=9F=92=A1 Int=
uitive Understanding: Restaurant Kitchen Analogy</h3>
<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Event Loop =3D Kitchen=
 Brigade System</h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Call Stack =3D Head Chef=
</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Executes current order (task)</=
li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Can only work on one dish at a =
time</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Cannot be interrupted once star=
ted</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Microtask Queue =3D Prep=
 Cooks</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Handle quick tasks (chopping, p=
lating)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Always prioritized over new ord=
ers</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Must finish ALL prep before tak=
ing new orders</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Macrotask Queue =3D Orde=
r Queue</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">New customer orders</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Processed one at a time</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Lower priority than prep work</=
li>
</ul>
