<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>A: Comprehensive Explana=
tion:</strong></p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Microtasks:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Definition</strong>: Hi=
gh-priority tasks executed trong current event loop cycle</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Examples</strong>: Prom=
ise.then(), queueMicrotask(), MutationObserver callbacks</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Execution</strong>: ALL=
 microtasks execute before ANY macrotask</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Use cases</strong>: Sta=
te updates c=E1=BA=A7n immediate consistency</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Macrotasks:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Definition</strong>: Lo=
wer-priority tasks scheduled cho future event loop cycles</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Examples</strong>: setT=
imeout(), setInterval(), I/O operations, UI events</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Execution</strong>: ONE=
 macrotask per event loop cycle</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Use cases</strong>: Tim=
e-based operations, I/O, user interactions</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Practical Implications:<=
